b without question, even when you're not around! So come back later, collect your rewards, and expand further. Guild Quest has been designed to be much more of a Second Screen kind of game you can run on the side (even while playing other games). <br><br>The challenge curve is up to you. Build the world you want to see then sit back and watch your Guildians go!","developers":["Hyper Hippo Games"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Playfab (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/547680/header.jpg?t=1497477445","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.6<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 120 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/547680/99876/bac17fed1ef60d270059e7bf4c60fc9ef092055e/1751300373/dash_av1.mpd?t=1493228063","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/547680/99876/bac17fed1ef60d270059e7bf4c60fc9ef092055e/1751300373/dash_h264.mpd?t=1493228063","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/547680/99876/bac17fed1ef60d270059e7bf4c60fc9ef092055e/1751300373/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1493228063","id":256683920,"name":"Beta Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256683920/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1493228063"}],"name":"Guild Quest","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 M